  "body": "From what I can see in several Web APIs such as WebUSB , Remote Playback and Presentation, they use `onconnect` and `ondisconnect`, not `onconnected` and `ondisconnected`, Therefore I believe we should follow that pattern and use `ongattserverdisconnect` instead of `ongattserverdisconnected`.\r\n\r\n```idl\r\n[ImplementedAs=ongattserverdisconnected] attribute EventHandler ongattserverdisconnect; \r\n```",
